title: Authorizations › Case page › Authorization facts
route: /authorizations/case/I-2207
intro: The row of facts under the 'Next:' block. A fact appears only when this request has the data for it. A request that is not approved yet shows no approved, used, left, window or review date, and a request with no Case Manager row shows no review date. The site shows only to a viewer who can see both sites. Nothing says 'N/A'.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the numbers come from the Case Manager ledger (read only) and the request's draft. Four requests to compare: R-1042 (not approved yet), I-2207 (48 units approved, 38 used, ends Fri 10/23), R-0988 (21 days approved, next review today) and R-0951 (14 days approved, window 10/20 to 11/3). The ledger records days used and the end date, not a start date, so the window of a request counted in days starts as many days before the demo's first day as days are used; units (IOP) have no calendar window.
---
screen fr "Authorization facts row\nUnder the 'Next:' block"
process f1 "'Request type'\nThe request's own type, e.g. Admission, Recertification, Peer-to-peer\nAlways shown"
process f2 "'Requested'\n'14 days'; IOP counts units: '21 units'\nAlways shown"
decision d1 "Does the Case Manager ledger have an approval for this request (days or units approved)?"
process f3 "'Approved'\n'48 units' with '38 used · 10 left'"
decision dW "Is the approval counted in days, and does the ledger give an end date for it?"
process fw "'Window'  '10/20 to 11/3' with 'ends in 14 d'\nShown instead of 'Approval ends' (it names the same end date)"
decision d2 "Does the ledger's next event say when the approval ends or when the next review is?"
process f4 "'Approval ends  Fri 10/23' with 'in 3 d'\nor 'Next review  Tue 10/20' with 'in 5 h'"
process f5 "No approved, used, left, expiry or review fact\nNothing is shown in their place"
decision d3 "Does the request have a draft in New case, or can one be made from it?"
decision dSt "Can the viewer see both sites?"
process fs "'Site'\n'Site A' with 'Main campus', or 'Site B' with 'Second campus'"
process f6 "'Documents'\n'8 of 9' with 'Missing: Therapy note from the last 14 days'\nor 'Complete' with 'All 9 in the packet'\nCounted against the documents the payer's saved list asks for"
decision d4 "Has the request been decided?"
process f7 "No 'Waiting on' fact"
process f8 "'Waiting on'\n'You' with 'to sign', 'an answer', 'peer-to-peer call' or 'after Scribe drafts'\nOr the payer, e.g. 'Summit' with 'decision'"
store src "Read only\nCase Manager ledger (units, review and expiry dates)\nThe request's draft and the payer's document list\nThe request on the Dashboard"
process wrap "Facts wrap onto a second line on a narrow window\nThe page never scrolls sideways"
goto g1 "Continues in: Case Manager › Active cases › Tracker of every active case"

fr --> f1 --> f2 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| f3 --> dW
d1 -->|No| f5
dW -->|Yes| fw --> d3
dW -->|No| d2
d2 -->|Yes| f4 --> d3
d2 -->|No| d3
f5 --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| f6 --> d4
d3 -->|No| d4
d4 -->|Yes| f7
d4 -->|No| f8
fr -.-> src
f8 --> dSt
f7 --> dSt
dSt -->|Yes| fs --> wrap
dSt -->|No| wrap
fr -.-> g1
